  <ferc:GeneralInformationOnPlantAndOperationsTextblock id="f-20" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;PINE NEEDLE LNG COMPANY, LLC OPERATES A LIQUEFIED NATURAL GAS STORAGE FACILITY (FACILITY) APPROXIMATELY ONE MILE FROM TRANSCONTINENTAL GAS PIPE LINE COMPANY, LLC&#8217;S MAIN LINE IN GUILFORD COUNTY, NORTH CAROLINA. THE FACILITY SERVES CUSTOMERS LOCATED IN NORTH CAROLINA, SOUTH CAROLINA, GEORGIA, ALABAMA, AND THE WASHINGTON D.C. AREA. THE FACILITY HAS THE CAPACITY TO LIQUEFY 20 MILLION CUBIC FEET OF GAS PER DAY (MMcf/d), VAPORIZE 400 MMcf/d AND PROVIDE 4 BILLION CUBIC FEET OF GAS STORAGE.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:GeneralInformationOnPlantAndOperationsTextblock>
